Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（拉炮声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我的真白 -真白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.21,0:00:09.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐！爸爸 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.81,0:00:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我软绵绵可可爱的真白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许久未见 过得还开心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:19.54,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 嗯 肯定的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.93,0:00:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？今年没有摆圣诞树吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:27.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那个啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:34.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,最近在忙很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都遇到什么事情了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:41.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么 都是些琐事 放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:45.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸和妈妈 即使不能在你身边 也会永远为真白加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 千万不要勉强自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.81,0:00:55.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 爸爸 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:01:01.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...要带搬的书都在这里了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.72,0:01:04.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.62,0:01:07.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我出去买点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:09.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.13,0:01:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你慢慢逛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:12.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:14.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一路顺风
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:17.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}蝶的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.67,0:01:19.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.26,0:01:22.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,要带着这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:27.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,信有送到吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.85,0:01:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,700)}{\an7}{\fs50}左右上下依次\N小蝶老师收 下次再一起玩 圣诞快乐 玲奈\N小蝶收 快回来 等你哦 勇气\N小蝶老师 还要再和我一起玩 阿健 \N小蝶老师 圣诞快乐 羽生\N（除了阿健 其他学生印象里剧中称呼过名字\N但片尾表里都只标为学生 记不清当时怎么译的了...）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天小蝶老师给大家的信送到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（欢呼声）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.91,0:01:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快读 快读
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:37.86,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,（天窗市幼儿园的大家收）大家过得还好？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:40.75,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,有尽情享受圣诞派对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.43,0:01:44.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,老师要出一个远门
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.98,0:01:48.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去帮助一位很宝贵的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:51.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,谁让老师是最强的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:54.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家也要珍惜朋友哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:57.83,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你们度过一个最快乐的圣诞节
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.69,0:02:00.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,此致敬礼 小蝶老师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 那棵树好大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:05.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}唯美着迷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}英雄们的圣诞节
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地的国民们都集合起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 阿翼他会张开能守护全城的护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管女帝她使用什么手段 待在这里都是安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.61,0:04:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘤嘤嘤...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.53,0:04:19.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,那个小宝宝在哭？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.54,0:04:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心里不踏实吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.27,0:04:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么安慰他们啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.47,0:04:26.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}两个人是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:32.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,写了好多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:35.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 就要写完了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.86,0:04:36.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（开门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿红！你这么早就到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了成为英雄上场战斗 我就赶过来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.81,0:04:55.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,满脑子战斗的话 就会变得看不清眼前的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:04:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胜负已分了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:00.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有真英雄的范儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:05.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.73,0:05:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3 2 1
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:15.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,幻镜平板护罩 启动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:31.90,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 这下就能放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是我儿子！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊 小翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.54,0:05:45.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你们两个...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然能做出这么优秀的东西...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.85,0:05:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小翼的梦想不断变大
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:57.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扩展到能够保护城里的人们了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我的梦想...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:04.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 爸爸 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:09.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,闪亮能量的护罩 能使暗塌谷能量失效
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:13.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,能够预防敌人入侵 以及抵御来自外部的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有这光的结界 大家就能很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是强大的后盾啊 谢谢你了 阿翼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:26.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这都得感谢由由博士的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个蓝天大地的国民即将全部进入城内
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色护卫队也有了净化乱暴兽的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在这里的成员们 也都做好了迎击女帝的准备
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次向你们拯救了蓝天大地的壮举 由衷地致以感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:51.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这是我们分内的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:53.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,要办的事情都办好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.09,0:06:54.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:57.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,化妆品也都带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.42,0:07:00.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,无化妆品飞扬不起来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:01.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:06.02,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,没精打采的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:07.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是在说集合在城里的国民们...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家的心里总有不踏实的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能有什么鼓舞他们的方法就好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:26.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,现在天窗市大街上很热闹 人们都笑眯眯的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.58,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,因为在过圣诞节啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞节？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.89,0:07:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道诞圣节...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.57,0:07:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一年要庆祝一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友们能够得到礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:39.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那不就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:41.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,和圣诞节一样的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞节和诞圣节
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.37,0:07:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然名字不同 不过节日活动都是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是现在这情况 谁还有庆祝诞圣节的心情啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:56.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诞圣节不庆祝 那这节日还有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:07:59.47,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,开派对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:04.83,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,开诞圣节派对吧！这样大家都能笑眯眯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:08.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,派对... 对啊 这个好！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:12.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,越是这种时候 就该开派对 让心情飞扬起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:15.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意啊 小公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:16.72,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,诶嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:20.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,既然决定了 开始做派对的准备！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.41,0:08:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 真白好熟练啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:28.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我也不能输给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:37.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小孩子们都很开心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:44.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:49.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,值得纪念的第1号...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.23,0:08:54.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:08:58.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,接着是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:01.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托把那座塔也装饰一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我去弄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天晚上 要开诞圣节派对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有美味的蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不会输给小晴的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:28.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我也不会输
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:30.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:36.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 小空 小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.83,0:09:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主在亲手帮忙布置...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她真善良 真聪明啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.26,0:09:49.03,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了！星星！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.59,0:09:51.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:55.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们那边的准备都结束 就来这里帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:57.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,做得真漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:58.09,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:00.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一口气搞定它！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.07,0:10:02.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:03.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:09.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 就这个我还弄不太会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:11.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:16.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有一种 回到了我们平时的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.23,0:10:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平时？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:21.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,之前都办过好几次了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:24.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎会啊 万圣节派对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:26.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,还有结婚仪式游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:29.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都笑眯眯的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:35.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 希望把笑眯眯快乐的心情 都能传递给大家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定能传到的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我这里有急事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.18,0:10:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一份机密任务要交给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:48.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,机密？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是与诞圣节相关的重大任务
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:57.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是在这一带的...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:10:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯嚯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:00.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯嚯嚯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:03.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:05.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那顶帽子...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:06.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:09.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞老鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:12.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:14.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真的存在啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:15.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,什么圣诞老鸟...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:19.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是蓝天大地！圣诞老人都是鸟族的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是感动的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.11,0:11:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.53,0:11:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把爱恶作剧的龙卷风赶走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:31.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好！大伙 上了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.33,0:11:33.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
