Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 好感动
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:09.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是比我们更震惊啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,雪橇还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪橇还好 但是有几个礼物被恶作剧龙卷风弄脏了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回家一趟 去换新的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:26.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也来帮忙运输
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 受你们照顾了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:36.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因为有好多小朋友 期待着圣诞老鸟的礼物呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:39.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？那间房间是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:44.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好多玩具！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:47.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都是手工制作的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是老太婆和我两个人做的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:53.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,做了蓝天大地全部小朋友的份吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用上一整年 每天都在做...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:16:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在诞圣节那天送给小朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.59,0:17:03.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 可是很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要小朋友们开心 辛苦一点又算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相对的 我们也会从大家那里 获得名为笑容的精美礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:16.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家的笑容...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:20.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:25.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,想要终结全部的纷争 让大家都笑出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:27.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的 你们能够消除那么难缠的恶作剧龙卷风
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纷争肯定可以终结的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:36.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:40.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,让蓝天大地重回温暖明亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:42.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,重回光明！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:44.34,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能够办到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:46.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙努力吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:52.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那首先... 要帮圣诞老鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:56.09,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,想让大家都笑眯眯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯嚯 那么 我们一起送吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:03.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,还有等礼物送完了 请到城里避难
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:05.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,有护罩了 那里很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能帮我们保密圣诞老鸟的身份吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:10.62,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:15.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好 首先要成功举办这次派对！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是一年一度的诞圣节
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请大家尽情地享受
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:24.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好好玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:56.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:58.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都笑了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:00.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:03.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,神彩飞扬！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wonderful！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:10.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不安静一点 会吵醒小朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:13.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 我兴致飞扬起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:17.65,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing也是 遇到圣诞老鸟的时候 那个闹腾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:20.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？那... 那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯嚯 到了 礼物拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:25.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:47.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,全都送完了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:50.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是 幸福的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:54.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 总觉得还缺点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:57.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,双色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.97,0:19:58.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.97,0:19:58.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:01.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:01.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:08.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,降降温吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:15.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:20.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞节就得要有雪啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯嚯嚯嚯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有礼物！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是圣诞老鸟送的礼物！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害！是礼物！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:34.98,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,笑眯眯...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:39.16,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:42.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 给你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:45.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:49.75,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我也该去睡了 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.39,0:20:53.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也回爸爸妈妈那里了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:54.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:55.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.59,0:20:59.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 能聊一聊吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:02.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这个 送你的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:02.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这个 送你的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:06.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,礼物是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:09.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴也是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.87,0:21:15.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,相同的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.01,0:21:20.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想送给真白同学 拜托小蝶姐帮我买的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（还记得那块看板上的宣传词吗？）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:25.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我的英雄手账是真白让给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（在特别日子送给特别的"她"）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:33.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴的手账差不多也该用完了 所以想在圣诞节送你新的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.11,0:21:36.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.11,0:21:36.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:38.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真开心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:39.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:41.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:45.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想保护这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一起努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.37,0:21:50.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:53.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诞圣快乐 真白同学
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.78,0:21:58.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.03,0:22:09.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Prism哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.03,0:22:09.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1045,970)}棱镜愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.73,0:22:12.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家试着跟我一起跳舞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:50.26,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空帮忙派送礼物 长大了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.62,0:23:52.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙快看 那光！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.93,0:23:54.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主可能碰上什么了...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.84,0:23:56.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！天空公主？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.13,0:23:59.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.13,0:23:59.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:03.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,再会了最亮星！公主的觉醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:18.12,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:23.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:31.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:36.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:40.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:46.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:51.14,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:57.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:03:01.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:05.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.69,0:03:05.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:07.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:07.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:12.80,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:17.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:22.77,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:27.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:30.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:38.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
